* Library of Optocoupler - VOM1271 - MOSFET Driver
* Date: 23.10.2024
* Copyright VISHAY, Inc. 2018 All Rights Reserved.
*
* ==== VOM1271 ====
*
* A = IRED Anode
* K = IRED Cathode
* IOP = MOSFET-Driver Positive Output
* ION = MOSFET-Driver Negative Output
*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
* ngspice/KiCad adaptation (User_KiCad_Libraries, 2026-11-18):
*  - LTspice instance parameter "n=13" (13 series PV diodes) replaced by an
*    equivalent single diode model PD13 (N = 13 x 1.7321, RS = 13 x 16 ohm)
*  - pin names +Iout/-Iout renamed to IOP/ION (ngspice node name syntax)
*  - LTspice-only ".backanno" removed
*  Checked in ngspice 45.2: Voc 8.39 V, Isc 15 uA at IF 10 mA (datasheet
*  8.4 V / 15 uA typ), toff ~66 us with CL 200 pF (datasheet 65 us typ).
*  Pins: A = LED anode, K = LED cathode, IOP = PV+ (pin 4), ION = PV- (pin 3)
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*$

.SUBCKT VOM1271 A K IOP ION

D1 A N005 TS8510VA
Vsense N005 K 0

H1 N001 0 Vsense 1
R1 N002 N001 10k
C1 N002 0 160p

RDUMMY ION 0 1G

G1 ION IOP N002 0 0.0015
D2 IOP ION PD13
S1 ION IOP N004 0 FastTurnOff
V1 N003 0 1
R2 N004 0 10
C3 N004 0 10u
W1 N003 N004 Vsense CSW_1

.model TS8510VA D(IS=59.194E-18 N=1.6363 RS=1.0000E-6 IKF=10.526E-3 CJO=1.0000E-12 M=.3333 VJ=.75 BV=100 IBV=100.00E-6 TT=5.0000E-9)

.model PD13 D(IS=8.377E-12 N=22.5173 RS=208 IKF=9)

.model FastTurnOff SW(Ron=100Meg Roff=1 VT=521mV VH=0)

.model CSW_1 CSW(Ron=1m Roff=100Meg  It=10uA Ih=10uA)

.ends

*$
